{title: Trust}
{lyricist: Sergio Rykov}
{composer: Sergio Rykov}

{start_of_verse}
Trust, and dream, and fly,
The horizon slips away
Why, what for? Do they part for evermore?
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
In your city there's snow, falling in white flakes
In the window I know, light. Only I'm not there.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse}
Trust, and dream, and fly,
The horizon's carried far
Why, what for? We run away from what we're facing.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
In my city there's snow, falling in white flakes
In the window I know, light. Only you're not there.
{end_of_chorus}
